{"title":"Career Roadmap · SEBI Compliance Executive","role":"SEBI Compliance Executive","summary":"A SEBI Compliance Executive works on regulatory compliance within organizations operating in India's securities and capital markets ecosystem.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Competition Law / Securities Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A SEBI Compliance Executive works on regulatory compliance within organizations operating in India's securities and capital markets ecosystem."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stockbroking firms"},{"text":"Portfolio managers"},{"text":"Asset management companies"},{"text":"Investment advisers"},{"text":"Research analysts"},{"text":"Merchant bankers"},{"text":"Alternative Investment Funds"},{"text":"Depository participants"},{"text":"Stock exchanges"},{"text":"Financial-services companies"},{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"FinTech and wealth-management businesses"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role involves helping an organization comply with applicable SEBI regulations, securities laws, disclosure requirements, internal policies and regulatory obligations."},{"type":"p","text":"A law graduate can be particularly valuable because the role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Securities Markets","Regulatory Compliance","Documentation","Risk Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"“SEBI Compliance Executive” is generally an employer-defined job title rather than a single statutory designation. Exact responsibilities and eligibility depend on the organization and the regulated activity. Some regulated functions may have separate qualification, certification, experience or “fit and proper” requirements under applicable SEBI regulations."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B. / Integrated LL.B.","Securities Law + Corporate Law","SEBI Regulations + Capital Markets Knowledge","Compliance Internship","Compliance Analyst / Legal Compliance Executive","SEBI Compliance Executive","Senior Compliance Executive / Compliance Officer","Compliance Manager","Head of Compliance","Chief Compliance Officer / Regulatory Compliance Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative Legal Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B.","Corporate / Securities Law Internship","Legal & Regulatory Associate","Capital Markets Compliance","Compliance Executive","Senior Compliance Professional"]}]},{"heading":"What Does a SEBI Compliance Executive Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role typically involves:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monitoring regulatory requirements"},{"text":"Tracking SEBI circulars and notifications"},{"text":"Maintaining compliance calendars"},{"text":"Reviewing regulatory filings"},{"text":"Supporting audits"},{"text":"Conducting compliance checks"},{"text":"Reviewing internal policies"},{"text":"Identifying regulatory risks"},{"text":"Maintaining compliance records"},{"text":"Supporting regulatory inspections"},{"text":"Reviewing client/investor documentation"},{"text":"Coordinating with legal, risk and operations teams"},{"text":"Escalating potential violations"},{"text":"Preparing compliance reports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A typical workflow is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SEBI Regulation / Circular","Identify Applicability","Interpret Requirement","Map Internal Process","Implement Control","Monitor Compliance","Document Evidence","Report / Escalate","Corrective Action"]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Build the Legal Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"During the first year of LL.B., focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal Methods"},{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"Constitutional Law"},{"text":"Law of Torts"},{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"Legal Writing"},{"text":"Business communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Develop these habits"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reading legislation carefully"},{"text":"Identifying legal obligations"},{"text":"Finding definitions"},{"text":"Understanding exceptions"},{"text":"Preparing legal summaries"},{"text":"Maintaining structured research notes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Compliance professionals must be extremely comfortable reading long regulatory documents and converting them into actionable requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Corporate & Business Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Company Law"},{"text":"Corporate Governance"},{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"Commercial Law"},{"text":"Intellectual Property"},{"text":"Insolvency fundamentals"},{"text":"Banking and financial law"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn corporate concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Board meetings"},{"text":"Shareholders"},{"text":"Securities"},{"text":"Equity"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Corporate disclosures"},{"text":"Related-party transactions"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Annual reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Securities & Capital Markets"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the key specialization stage."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Securities Markets"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Primary markets"},{"text":"Secondary markets"},{"text":"Equity markets"},{"text":"Debt markets"},{"text":"Derivatives"},{"text":"Mutual funds"},{"text":"Alternative investment funds"},{"text":"Portfolio management"},{"text":"Investment advisory"},{"text":"Research analysis"},{"text":"Stockbroking"},{"text":"Depositories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the roles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEBI"},{"text":"Stock exchanges"},{"text":"Depositories"},{"text":"Clearing corporations"},{"text":"Intermediaries"},{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"Investors"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Compliance Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Compliance calendars"},{"text":"Regulatory filings"},{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Compliance testing"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"},{"text":"Audit support"},{"text":"Policy drafting"},{"text":"Regulatory change management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is to move from:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I know the regulation”"},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"“I can determine whether an organization is complying with the regulation.”"}]},{"heading":"Core Securities-Law Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate should understand major areas such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEBI regulatory framework"},{"text":"Securities Contracts framework"},{"text":"Depositories framework"},{"text":"Companies Act provisions relevant to securities"},{"text":"Insider trading regulations"},{"text":"Takeover regulations"},{"text":"Listing and disclosure requirements"},{"text":"Mutual fund regulations"},{"text":"AIF regulations"},{"text":"Portfolio manager regulations"},{"text":"Investment adviser regulations"},{"text":"Research analyst regulations"},{"text":"Stockbroker regulations"},{"text":"Market-abuse concepts"},{"text":"Corporate governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Because securities regulations change frequently, students should always work from the latest applicable SEBI regulations, circulars, master circulars and official notifications."}]},{"heading":"Insider Trading Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is an important area."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unpublished price sensitive information"},{"text":"Insider"},{"text":"Designated persons"},{"text":"Trading restrictions"},{"text":"Trading windows"},{"text":"Pre-clearance"},{"text":"Structured digital databases"},{"text":"Disclosure requirements"},{"text":"Code of conduct"},{"text":"Monitoring mechanisms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Potential UPSI","Identify Persons With Access","Trading Restriction","Internal Recording","Disclosure / Monitoring","Compliance Review"]}]},{"heading":"Listing & Disclosure Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For listed-company environments, learn about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Material events"},{"text":"Corporate announcements"},{"text":"Periodic disclosures"},{"text":"Shareholding disclosures"},{"text":"Corporate governance requirements"},{"text":"Related-party transactions"},{"text":"Board disclosures"},{"text":"Investor communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The compliance professional helps ensure that required information is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["accurate","timely","properly approved","properly documented."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Takeover & M&A Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acquisition of shares"},{"text":"Change in control"},{"text":"Open-offer concepts"},{"text":"Promoter holdings"},{"text":"Public shareholders"},{"text":"Disclosure obligations"},{"text":"Due diligence"},{"text":"Transaction documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is especially useful for lawyers working in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investment banks"},{"text":"Merchant banking"},{"text":"Corporate law firms"},{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"Capital-markets teams"}]}]},{"heading":"Compliance Monitoring","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A compliance executive should know how to create a compliance monitoring system."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"table","header":["Requirement","Frequency","Owner","Evidence","Status"],"rows":[[{"text":"Regulatory filing"},{"text":"Monthly"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Filing receipt"},{"text":"Completed"}],[{"text":"Disclosure review"},{"text":"Event-based"},{"text":"Legal"},{"text":"Approval record"},{"text":"Pending"}],[{"text":"Internal compliance test"},{"text":"Quarterly"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Test report"},{"text":"Completed"}],[{"text":"Policy review"},{"text":"Annual"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Revised policy"},{"text":"Due"}],[{"text":"Regulatory update"},{"text":"Ongoing"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Regulatory tracker"},{"text":"Active"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"This type of system is extremely useful in real organizations."}]},{"heading":"Compliance Calendar","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create a regulatory calendar covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Filing deadlines"},{"text":"Disclosure deadlines"},{"text":"Audit dates"},{"text":"Policy reviews"},{"text":"Board approvals"},{"text":"Regulatory certifications"},{"text":"Internal testing"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Reporting"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulatory Requirement","Deadline","Responsible Person","Required Document","Internal Approval","Submission","Evidence Storage"]}]},{"heading":"Regulatory Change Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SEBI frequently updates its regulatory framework."},{"type":"p","text":"A compliance executive needs to convert regulatory changes into internal actions."},{"type":"h","text":"Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["New SEBI Circular","Read & Interpret","Identify Applicability","Compare With Existing Policy","Identify Compliance Gap","Assign Action","Implement Change","Test","Document"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most valuable practical skills for the role."}]},{"heading":"Legal Research Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to efficiently locate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEBI regulations"},{"text":"SEBI circulars"},{"text":"Master circulars"},{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Guidance"},{"text":"Exchange circulars"},{"text":"Depository circulars"},{"text":"Relevant legislation"},{"text":"Case law"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful legal research platforms include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SCC Online"},{"text":"Manupatra"},{"text":"LexisNexis"},{"text":"Westlaw"},{"text":"Indian Kanoon"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Always verify important regulatory conclusions against the current official source."}]},{"heading":"Competition Law Connection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because the specialization includes Competition Law / Securities Law, develop basic competition-law knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Anti-competitive agreements"},{"text":"Cartels"},{"text":"Abuse of dominant position"},{"text":"Combinations"},{"text":"Competition Commission of India"},{"text":"Market definition"},{"text":"Competitive effects"},{"text":"Merger review"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can become useful when working with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial-sector mergers"},{"text":"Market infrastructure"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Investment businesses"},{"text":"M&A transactions"}]}]},{"heading":"Compliance Risk Assessment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to evaluate:"},{"type":"p","text":"What can go wrong?"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Late regulatory filing"},{"text":"Incorrect disclosure"},{"text":"Insider trading"},{"text":"Unauthorized transactions"},{"text":"Conflict of interest"},{"text":"Inadequate documentation"},{"text":"Customer due-diligence gaps"},{"text":"Policy violations"},{"text":"Inappropriate handling of confidential information"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk model"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulatory Requirement","Potential Failure","Probability","Impact","Risk Rating","Control","Monitoring"]}]},{"heading":"Internal Controls","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the concept of preventive and detective controls."},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trading restrictions"},{"text":"Approval workflows"},{"text":"Access controls"},{"text":"Segregation of duties"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Detective"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance testing"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Exception reports"},{"text":"Periodic audits"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Corrective"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Remediation"},{"text":"Policy updates"},{"text":"Employee training"},{"text":"Escalation"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting where applicable"}]}]},{"heading":"Compliance Documentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build strong documentation skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Common documents include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance reports"},{"text":"Regulatory trackers"},{"text":"Legal opinions"},{"text":"Policy documents"},{"text":"Compliance checklists"},{"text":"Board reports"},{"text":"Risk assessments"},{"text":"Audit responses"},{"text":"Regulatory correspondence"},{"text":"Training records"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A compliance professional should be able to answer:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Show me the evidence that this requirement was complied with.”"}]},{"heading":"Tools & Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Excel"},{"text":"Microsoft Word"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"PDF tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Compliance trackers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL basics"},{"text":"Compliance-management platforms"},{"text":"GRC tools"},{"text":"Contract-management systems"},{"text":"Regulatory intelligence platforms"}]}]},{"heading":"AI for Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is increasingly useful in regulatory compliance workflows."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory document summarization"},{"text":"Regulatory change tracking"},{"text":"Policy comparison"},{"text":"Compliance obligation extraction"},{"text":"Contract review"},{"text":"Risk classification"},{"text":"Regulatory research assistance"},{"text":"Compliance-report preparation"},{"text":"Document classification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["New Regulation","AI-Assisted Summary","Human Legal Verification","Compliance Obligation Mapping","Internal Control Mapping","Gap Analysis","Implementation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Never treat an AI-generated regulatory interpretation as authoritative without checking the current applicable regulatory text."}]},{"heading":"Projects During LL.B.","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — SEBI Compliance Tracker"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an Excel-based tracker with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulation"},{"text":"Requirement"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Responsible department"},{"text":"Deadline"},{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Status"},{"text":"Risk level"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Insider Trading Compliance Framework"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a fictional listed-company framework covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UPSI identification"},{"text":"Designated persons"},{"text":"Trading restrictions"},{"text":"Trading-window controls"},{"text":"Disclosure tracking"},{"text":"Compliance reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Listed Company Compliance Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a public company and study its publicly available disclosures."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Shareholding"},{"text":"Material disclosures"},{"text":"Related-party disclosures"},{"text":"Annual-report compliance information"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Regulatory Change Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a regulatory update and prepare:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Old Requirement","New Requirement","What Changed?","Who Is Affected?","Compliance Gap","Required Action"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Compliance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Open compliance tasks"},{"text":"Upcoming deadlines"},{"text":"High-risk items"},{"text":"Overdue actions"},{"text":"Department-wise compliance"},{"text":"Regulatory categories"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate law firms"},{"text":"Legal research teams"},{"text":"General compliance teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Securities-law firms"},{"text":"Corporate law firms"},{"text":"Financial institutions"},{"text":"Listed companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brokerages"},{"text":"Asset management companies"},{"text":"Investment firms"},{"text":"Compliance departments"},{"text":"Capital-markets law firms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Securities-law teams"},{"text":"SEBI-regulated intermediaries"},{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance departments"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Stockbroker"},{"text":"Securities Regulations + Compliance Monitoring"}],[{"text":"AMC"},{"text":"Mutual Fund Regulations + Compliance"}],[{"text":"Listed Company"},{"text":"Disclosure + Corporate Governance"}],[{"text":"Investment Adviser"},{"text":"Regulatory Compliance + Documentation"}],[{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"Securities Regulations + Research Compliance"}],[{"text":"AIF"},{"text":"Fund Regulations + Compliance"}],[{"text":"Merchant Banker"},{"text":"Capital Markets + Transaction Compliance"}],[{"text":"Law Firm"},{"text":"Securities Law + Legal Research"}],[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Securities + Technology + Regulatory Compliance"}],[{"text":"Compliance Consultancy"},{"text":"Multi-regulatory Compliance + Reporting"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas of study include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Securities Law"},{"text":"Capital Markets"},{"text":"Corporate Governance"},{"text":"Compliance Management"},{"text":"Insider Trading"},{"text":"Investment Products"},{"text":"Mutual Funds"},{"text":"Financial Markets"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"AML/KYC fundamentals"},{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"Competition Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional certifications"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore relevant NISM certifications aligned with the specific securities-market function you want to enter."},{"type":"p","text":"The exact certification should be selected based on the employer and regulated activity because not every NISM certification applies to every compliance role."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"LL.M."},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant options:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LL.M. in Corporate Law"},{"text":"LL.M. in Business Law"},{"text":"LL.M. in Securities Law"},{"text":"LL.M. in Banking & Finance Law"},{"text":"LL.M. in Corporate & Commercial Law"},{"text":"LL.M. in Competition Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative PG"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"MBA Financial Markets"},{"text":"MBA Risk Management"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Securities/Capital Markets"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Financial Compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a law graduate, securities law + financial markets knowledge can be a particularly strong combination."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience, the professional can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Securities Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory compliance for capital-market participants."},{"type":"h","text":"Listed-Company Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Disclosures and corporate governance."},{"type":"h","text":"Insider Trading Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"UPSI, trading restrictions and monitoring."},{"type":"h","text":"Investment Adviser Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory requirements for investment-advisory businesses."},{"type":"h","text":"Mutual Fund Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Fund-level and AMC regulatory requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"AIF Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative investment fund regulations."},{"type":"h","text":"Broker Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Stockbroker and trading-related regulatory requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Securities regulation combined with technology."},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Investigations"},{"type":"p","text":"Internal investigations and regulatory responses."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Legal Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Regulatory Research Associate"},{"text":"Legal & Compliance Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEBI Compliance Executive"},{"text":"Compliance Officer"},{"text":"Regulatory Compliance Associate"},{"text":"Securities Compliance Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–10 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Compliance Officer"},{"text":"Compliance Manager"},{"text":"Regulatory Affairs Manager"},{"text":"Securities-Law Counsel"},{"text":"Compliance Head — smaller organization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"10+ Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Head of Compliance"},{"text":"Chief Compliance Officer"},{"text":"Regulatory Affairs Head"},{"text":"Senior Securities Counsel"},{"text":"Legal & Compliance Director"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact senior titles and statutory responsibilities vary by regulated entity and applicable regulations."}]},{"heading":"Emerging Opportunities","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Emerging Area","Opportunity"],"rows":[[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"}],[{"text":"Algorithmic Trading"},{"text":"Market conduct controls"}],[{"text":"AI in Finance"},{"text":"AI governance"}],[{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Automated compliance"}],[{"text":"Digital Assets"},{"text":"Evolving regulatory analysis"}],[{"text":"ESG"},{"text":"Disclosure and governance"}],[{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Financial-sector compliance"}],[{"text":"Data Protection"},{"text":"Investor/customer data governance"}],[{"text":"SupTech"},{"text":"Technology-enabled supervision"}],[{"text":"Digital Investment Platforms"},{"text":"Regulatory controls"}]]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should demonstrate:"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Knowledge"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Securities law"},{"text":"Corporate law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Competition law"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Corporate governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Securities Knowledge"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Capital markets"},{"text":"Equity and debt"},{"text":"Mutual funds"},{"text":"AIFs"},{"text":"Stockbroking"},{"text":"Investment advisory"},{"text":"Listed-company framework"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory research"},{"text":"Compliance mapping"},{"text":"Compliance calendars"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Regulatory reporting"},{"text":"Audit support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Compliance tools"},{"text":"Legal research databases"},{"text":"AI-assisted regulatory research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"1 SEBI compliance tracker"},{"text":"1 insider-trading compliance framework"},{"text":"1 listed-company compliance analysis"},{"text":"1 regulatory-change report"},{"text":"1 compliance dashboard"},{"text":"2+ relevant internships"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"LL.B."},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Securities Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SEBI Regulatory Framework"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Corporate Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Capital Markets"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Competition Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Compliance Management"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory Research"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Risk Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Corporate Governance"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Insider Trading Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"RegTech / AI"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant NISM Learning"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Financial-Sector Internship"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile for a SEBI Compliance Executive is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B.","Securities Law","SEBI Regulatory Knowledge","Capital Markets","Corporate Governance","Compliance Management","Regulatory Research","Risk & Controls","Advanced Excel/Power BI","Relevant NISM Certification","Financial-Sector Internship"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The key differentiator is to become a law graduate who understands both the legal text and the operational side of financial-market compliance—someone who can read a SEBI requirement, determine who it applies to, convert it into an internal control, track compliance, document evidence and identify regulatory risk."}]}]}